  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/hpsc-pgt-computer-science-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Haryana Public Service Commission (HPSC)</span></a> has released the Final result for the post of Graduate Teacher PGT (Computer Science). This recruitment has been issued for 1672 posts. Online applying process for HPSC PGT Computer Science Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 16 February 2026 to 09 March 2026. The examination was held on 17 May 2026. Candidates must download their HPSC PGT Computer Science Final Result 2026 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Haryana Public Service Commission (HPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">HPSC PGT Computer Science Final Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">HPSC PGT Advt No. : 23/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>05 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>16 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>09 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>09 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffffff;\">New Exam Date : <strong>17 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>06 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Result : <strong>21 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, Other State :<strong> Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, BC-A, BC-B, EWS, ESM :<strong> Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong> Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>HPSC PGT Computer Science Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 09 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>42 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Haryana HPSC PGT Computer Science Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>HPSC PGT Computer Science 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1672 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.9322%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.9322%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher PGT (Computer Science)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">902</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">171</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">342</s