-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to&nbsp;<span class=\"google-anno-t\">check</span> their HPSC PGT Computer Science Final Result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also check their HPSC PGT Computer Science Final Result from official site of the HPSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>HPSC PGT Computer Science Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Screening Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Subject Knowledge Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview / Viva-Voce</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"t